        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Competitiveness with China is essential for maintaining U.S. economic and strategic advantage.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Reshoring industries enhances national resilience and reduces dependency on adversarial powers.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Future U.S. leadership must prioritize long-term strategic competition with China.",
