    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95568.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 75,
    "turn_text": "So, but I do wonder, is there something about Gen X that keeps you from, I mean, obviously, you know, you're sand which between these two gigantic generations, is there something that keeps Gen Xers from even with kind of those attributes that you're talking about from being able to connect with either side, I guess?",
