      },
      {
        "text": "The listener has insight into how Gen Xers relate socially.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Being 'sandwiched' generationally implies emotional or social tension.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Attributes discussed earlier are relevant to intergenerational connection.",
        "confidence": 0.84
